    "turn_text": "Yeah, I was, I really bummed the Olympics was moved to, I mean, not from a health perspective, I'm glad they took care of the athletes, but my daughter was at that age where she was going to meet like Katie Ledecky and Lily King and some of those great athletes. So we're, we've got the clock set for next summer.",
