    "turn_text": "What I like is you talk very candidly about your fandom, but in a way, I feel like a lot of people who get into public life or politics feel this need to pander. Like, oh, now I'm going to throw on my dusty socks cap and present myself as like a mega fan. It feels very John Cusack to me. And I like how you're just like, look, I live in this area. I have sort of these other allegiances, but my focus is shifted a little bit. I don't need to put on errors or play the game in terms of where my allegiances lie. But do you feel pressure to do that ever now that you've stepped into an elected position?",
