    "turn_text": "Yeah, that's probably true. I mean, to be honest, whenever I hear, you know, my colleagues, you know, including some high-profile ones, talk about how excited they were about, you know, the result in some game the night before I'm sitting there and thinking like, There's no way you had time to watch that game. We were at the same event. I know how long these days are. I know how hard you work. There's no way it's cool that you pick your team. You're Raven's one last night, but you weren't watching it. I don't know. You got to be honest about where it is. I wish I had time to watch it.",
